  "body": "Refs #416\nDirect-PR: operator decision 2026-11-06 (option A, recorded on #368), docs only, self-merged when CI is green. #416 stays open: cloud/orch closes it as not planned.\n\nThe problem: LOT-176 (M5) lists the HD gallery with swipe, which LOT-109 (#472, merged as 9dcd2ba) already ships; FEAT-014 still read \"proposed\".\n\nWhat changed: `docs/LOTS.md` (LOT-109 and LOT-176 rows, the 109b split row), `docs/lots/LOT-176-hd-gallery.md` (stub replaced by an Outcome section: nothing left), `docs/FEATURES.md` (FEAT-014 done), regenerated `tooling/roadmap/lots.json`. The LOT-176 row is kept until the issue is closed, so the plan and the boards stay consistent.\n\nTests: `scripts/check-lot-deps.py` (164 lots, 0 violation) and `scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py` pass.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEBkjmFApUaMrewUvD)_\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the roadmap to show the HD image gallery with swipe and viewer as shipped with LOT-109.\n  * Marked LOT-176 as having no remaining work and to be closed as not planned.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
